        "cooked": "<p>NotMist?  That’s hilarious; there should definitely be a Disparation of that.</p>\n<p>Did you explain somewhere who Heartshield is?  Obviously Trainwreck is an alternate Heartbreaker, and I love that name for him (it rather sounds more fitting than the real one), but the only other character who obviously connects with him is Dr. Tremata.  So is Heartshield a superheroic Dr. Tremata who stopped Trainwreck from murdering her?</p>",
